# OWNER: Nour - Search & Directory tests (VS Code REST Client: click "Send Request")
# Run in order on fresh sample data (npm run setup-db). Demo password for every sample employee: password123
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### Login as HR (Salma) -> 200
# @name hrLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/employees/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "salma.nabil@example.com", "password": "password123" }

### ---------- Function 1: Directory search ----------

### D1 First page (people who left are hidden) -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D2 Text search -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?q=omar
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D3 Department + skill filter -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?department=DEP-eng&skill=sql
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D4 Former staff only -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?status=Left
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D5 Sorted by seniority, paged -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?sort=seniority&page=2&limit=3
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D6 Invalid options -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?page=0&limit=500&sort=height
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D7 Page past the end -> 400 PAGE_OUT_OF_RANGE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory?page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### ---------- Function 2: Expert finder ----------

### D8 Rank by skills; shows missing skills and skills nobody has -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/experts?skills=sql,aws,python,kubernetes
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D9 Only available people in one department -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/experts?skills=crm,communication&department=DEP-sales&available=true
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D10 No skills given -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/experts
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### ---------- Function 3: Reporting path finder ----------

### D11 Two people in different departments -> 200, shared manager Layla Hassan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/path?from=EMP-003&to=EMP-005
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D12 Employee to their manager -> 200, "is above"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/path?from=EMP-007&to=EMP-006
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D13 Same person -> 400 SAME_EMPLOYEE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/path?from=EMP-003&to=EMP-003
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D14 Missing "to" -> 400 VALIDATION_ERROR
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/path?from=EMP-003
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### ---------- Profile view ----------

### D15 Details with reporting line and team -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/EMP-003
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D16 Unknown employee -> 404 EMPLOYEE_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/EMP-nope
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### D17 Filter values for the page -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory/filters
Authorization: Bearer {{hrLogin.response.body.token}}

### ---------- Security ----------

### D18 No token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/directory
